  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative Agreement to support victims and survivors of conflicts and violence in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program supports victims and survivors of conflicts and violence in Iraq. The goal of the program was to deliver a range of services to assist displaced populations in Iraq, including providing emergency shelter, water, sanitation, and hygiene (WASH) support, as well as other protection and social services for vulnerable individuals affected by ongoing conflicts and violence in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
